    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u6BD5\u7ADF\u6211\u8D1F\u8D23\u7684\u662F\u7269\u8D44\u91C7\u8D2D\u548C\u534F\u8C03\u5DE5\u4F5C\u2026\u73B0\u5728\u7684\u72B6\u51B5\u7528\u4E0D\u4E0A\u91C7\u8D2D\uFF0C\u4E5F\u6CA1\u6709\u7269\u8D44\u3002"
    en: ' After all, I am responsible for procurement and coordination... '
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 1
    enBranch:
    - In our current situation, there is no use for procurement, and there are no
      supplies.
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u81F3\u4E8E\u534F\u8C03\u5DE5\u4F5C\u2026\u8FD9\u513F\u770B\u7740\u4E5F\u4E0D\u50CF\u662F\u6709\u4EC0\u4E48\u5176\u4ED6\u5546\u961F\u7684\u6837\u5B50\u3002"
    en: ' As for coordination... this place does not look like it has any other caravans
      around.'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
